Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}どうだ　アリト！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}熱い魂を思い出せ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起你那炽热的灵魂吧！
